GET {{baseUrl}}/oauth/me

::: auth oauth2
profile = sample-machine
scope = users:write

::: post
test("the request asks for its own scope", () => {
  expect(res.status).toBe(200);
  expect(res.json().scope).toBe("users:write");
});

::: docs
Overrides the scope of `sample-machine`: it gets a token of its own, stored apart from the
profile's.
